YuNet face detection model (face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx)
==============================================================
Source:  libfacedetection — https://github.com/ShiqiYu/libfacedetection
         (model: YuNet, by Prof. Shiqi Yu and Wei Wu)
License: MIT

MIT — permits commercial use, modification, and distribution with attribution + this notice.

NOTE: this is only the ~230 KB ONNX weights file. It is run in pure Rust via `tract` (like the
YOLOX person detector); NO OpenCV / native library is used or linked. The ArcFace embedder +
recognition remain on the cloud AI sidecar.
